#: picard/script/functions.py:73
msgid "$if(if,then[,else])"
msgstr "$if(if,then[,else])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:74
msgid "If `if` is not empty, it returns `then`, otherwise it returns `else`."
msgstr "如果 `if` 不为空，则返回 `then`；否则返回 `else`。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:86
msgid "$if2(a1,a2,a3,…)"
msgstr "$if2(a1,a2,a3,…)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:87
msgid "Returns first non empty argument."
msgstr "返回第一个非空参数。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:99
msgid "Does nothing (useful for comments or disabling a block of code)."
msgstr "不执行任何操作（适用于注释或禁用一段代码）。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:106
msgid "$left(text,number)"
msgstr "$left(text,number)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:107
msgid "Returns the first `number` characters from `text`."
msgstr "返回 `text` 中的前 `number` 个字符。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:117
msgid "$right(text,number)"
msgstr "$right(text,number)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:118
msgid "Returns the last `number` characters from `text`."
msgstr "返回 `text` 中的最后 `number` 个字符。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:128
msgid "$lower(text)"
msgstr "$lower(text)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:129
msgid "Returns `text` in lower case."
msgstr "将 `text` 转换为小写后返回。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:136
msgid "$upper(text)"
msgstr "$upper(text)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:137
msgid "Returns `text` in upper case."
msgstr "将 `text` 转换为大写并返回。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:144
msgid "$pad(text,length,char)"
msgstr "$pad(text,length,char)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:146
msgid ""
"Pads the `text` to the `length` provided by adding as many copies of `char` "
"as needed to the **beginning** of the string."
msgstr ""
"将 `text` 补足至指定的 `length`，方法是在字符串的**开头**添加所需数量的 "
"`char` 副本。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:158
msgid "$strip(text)"
msgstr "$strip(text)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:160
msgid ""
"Replaces all whitespace in `text` with a single space, and removes leading "
"and trailing spaces.\n"
"Whitespace characters include multiple consecutive spaces, and various other "
"unicode characters."
msgstr ""
"将 `text` 中的所有空白字符替换为单个空格，并删除开头和结尾的空格。\n"
"空白字符包括多个连续的空格以及其他各种 Unicode 字符。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:169
msgid "$replace(text,search,replace)"
msgstr "$replace(text,search,replace)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:171
msgid ""
"Replaces occurrences of `search` in `text` with value of `replace` and "
"returns the resulting string."
msgstr "将 `text` 中所有 `search` 替换为 `replace` 的值，并返回结果字符串。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:180
msgid "$replacemulti(name,search,replace[,separator=; ])"
msgstr "$replacemulti(name,search,replace[,separator=; ])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:182
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Replaces occurrences of `search` with `replace` in the multi-value variable "
"`name`.\n"
"Empty elements are automatically removed.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $replacemulti(%genre%,Idm,IDM)\n"
msgstr ""
"将多值变量 `name` 中出现的 `search` 替换为 `replace`。\n"
"空元素将被自动移除。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $replacemulti(%genre%,Idm,IDM)\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:206
msgid "$in(x,y)"
msgstr "$in(x,y)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:207
msgid "Returns true, if `x` contains `y`."
msgstr "如果 `x` 包含 `y`，则返回 true。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:218
#, python-format
msgid "$inmulti(%x%,y)"
msgstr "$inmulti(%x%,y)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:220
msgid ""
"Returns true if multi-value variable `x` contains exactly `y` as one of its "
"values.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 1.0_"
msgstr ""
"如果多值变量 `x` 的值中恰好包含 `y`，则返回 true。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 1.0 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:236
msgid "$rreplace(text,pattern,replace)"
msgstr "$rreplace(text,pattern,replace)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:238
msgid ""
"[Regular expression](https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html#regular-"
"expression-syntax) replace."
msgstr ""
"[正则表达式](https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html#regular-expression-"
"syntax) 替换。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:249
msgid "$rsearch(text,pattern[,group])"
msgstr "$rsearch(text,pattern[,group])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:251
msgid ""
"[Regular expression](https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html#regular-"
"expression-syntax) search.\n"
"\n"
"If the optional `group` parameter is not provided or is empty, return the "
"first\n"
"capture group which matched something (including the empty string) or the\n"
"entire match.\n"
"\n"
"If `group` is an integer, return the capture group in the position matching "
"this integer.\n"
"Otherwise, return the capture group named `group`, sans surrounding "
"whitespace.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"\n"
"    $rsearch(disc: 1,disc: \\(\\\\d+\\)) => \"1\"\n"
"    $rsearch(disc: 2,\\(\\\\w+\\): \\(\\\\d+\\),1) => \"disc\"\n"
"    $rsearch(disc: 3,\\(\\\\w+\\): \\(\\\\d+\\),2) => \"3\"\n"
"    $rsearch(disc: 4,disc: \\(?P<disc>\\\\d+\\),disc) => \"4\"\n"
"    $rsearch(disc: none,disc\\(: \\\\d+\\)?) => \"disc\"\n"
"    $rsearch(disc: /5,disc: \\(\\\\d+\\)?/\\\\d+,1) => \"\"\n"
"\n"
"_group parameter since Picard 3.0_"
msgstr ""
"[正则表达式](https://docs.python.org/3/library/re.html#regular-expression-"
"syntax) 搜索。\n"
"\n"
"如果未提供可选参数 `group` 或该参数为空，则返回第一个\n"
"匹配到内容（包括空字符串）的捕获组，或者返回\n"
"整个匹配结果。\n"
"\n"
"如果 `group` 是整数，则返回与该整数位置匹配的捕获组。\n"
"否则，返回名为 `group` 的捕获组，不包含周围的空格。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $rsearch(disc: 1,disc: \\(\\\\d+\\)) => \"1\"\n"
"    $rsearch(disc: 2,\\(\\\\w+\\): \\(\\\\d+\\),1) => \"disc\"\n"
"    $rsearch(disc: 3,\\(\\\\w+\\): \\(\\\\d+\\),2) => \"3\"\n"
"    $rsearch(disc: 4,disc: \\(?P<disc>\\\\d+\\),disc) => \"4\"\n"
"    $rsearch(disc: none,disc\\(: \\\\d+\\)?) => \"disc\"\n"
"    $rsearch(disc: /5,disc: \\(\\\\d+\\)?/\\\\d+,1) => \"\"\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 3.0 起新增的 _group 参数_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:297
msgid "$num(number,length)"
msgstr "$num(number,length)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:298
msgid "Returns `number` formatted to `length` digits (maximum 20)."
msgstr "返回按 `length` 位（最多 20 位）格式化后的 `number`。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:313
msgid "$unset(name)"
msgstr "$unset(name)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:315
msgid ""
"Unsets the variable `name`.\n"
"Allows for wildcards to unset certain tags (works with \"performer:\\*\", "
"\"comment:\\*\", and \"lyrics:\\*\").\n"
"For example `$unset(performer:*)` would unset all performer tags."
msgstr ""
"取消设置变量 `name`。\n"
"支持使用通配符来取消设置某些标签（适用于 \"performer:\\*\"、\"comment:\\*\" "
"和 \"lyrics:\\*\"）。\n"
"例如，`$unset(performer:*)` 将取消设置所有表演者标签。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:334
msgid "$delete(name)"
msgstr "$delete(name)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:336
msgid ""
"Unsets the variable `name` and marks the tag for deletion.\n"
"This is similar to `$unset(name)` but also marks the tag for deletion. E.g.\n"
"    running `$delete(genre)` will actually remove the genre tag from a file "
"when\n"
"    saving.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 2.1_"
msgstr ""
"取消设置变量 `name`，并标记该标签以供删除。\n"
"这与 `$unset(name)` 类似，但还会将该标签标记为待删除。例如：\n"
"    执行 `$delete(genre)` 将在保存文件时\n"
"    实际移除该文件的流派标签。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 2.1 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:350
msgid "$set(name,value)"
msgstr "$set(name,value)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:352
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Sets the variable `name` to `value`.\n"
"\n"
"Note: To create a variable which can be used for the file naming string, "
"but\n"
"    which will not be written as a tag in the file, prefix the variable "
"name\n"
"    with an underscore. `%something%` will create a \"something\" tag;\n"
"    `%_something%` will not."
msgstr ""
"将变量 `name` 设置为 `value`。\n"
"\n"
"注意：若要创建一个可用于文件命名字符串、但\n"
"    不会作为标签写入文件中的变量，请在变量名前\n"
"    添加下划线。`%something%` 将生成“something”标签；\n"
"    而 `%_something%` 则不会。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:369
msgid "$setmulti(name,value[,separator=; ])"
msgstr "$setmulti(name,value[,separator=; ])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:371
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Sets the variable `name` to `value`, using the separator (or \"; \" if not "
"passed)\n"
"    to coerce the value back into a proper multi-valued tag. This can be "
"used to\n"
"    operate on multi-valued tags as a string, and then set them back as "
"proper\n"
"    multi-valued tags.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $setmulti(genre,$lower(%genre%))\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 1.0_"
msgstr ""
"将变量 `name` 设置为 `value`，并使用分隔符（若未传入则使用“; ”）\n"
"    将该值强制转换回正确的多值标签。这可用于\n"
"    将多值标签作为字符串进行操作，然后将其重新设置为正确的\n"
"    多值标签。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $setmulti(genre,$lower(%genre%))\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 1.0 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:388
msgid "$get(name)"
msgstr "$get(name)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:389
msgid "Returns the variable `name` (equivalent to `%name%`)."
msgstr "返回变量 `name`（等同于 `%name%`）。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:397
msgid "$get_new(name)"
msgstr "$get_new(name)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:399
msgid ""
"Returns the value of the variable `name` from the new metadata only\n"
"(from MusicBrainz or set by a script), ignoring values that only exist in "
"the\n"
"file's original tags.\n"
"\n"
"This is useful to check whether MusicBrainz actually provided a specific "
"tag.\n"
"When a file is matched to a track, `%name%` may return a value from the "
"file's\n"
"existing tags even if MusicBrainz did not provide one. `$get_new` only "
"returns\n"
"the value if it was set by MusicBrainz or by a script.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $if($get_new(composer),,$set(composer,$if2(%lyricist%,%writer%,"
"%arranger%)))\n"
"\n"
"This sets the composer from other fields only if MusicBrainz did not provide "
"one,\n"
"regardless of what composer tag the file originally had.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 3.0_"
msgstr ""
"仅返回新元数据中变量 `name` 的值\n"
"（来自 MusicBrainz 或由脚本设置），忽略仅存在于\n"
"文件原始标签中的值。\n"
"\n"
"这有助于检查 MusicBrainz 是否确实提供了某个特定标签。\n"
"当文件与某首曲目匹配时，即使 MusicBrainz 未提供该标签，`%name%` 仍可能返回来"
"自文件\n"
"现有标签中的值。而 `$get_new` 仅在该值由 MusicBrainz 或脚本设置时才返回\n"
"该值。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $if($get_new(composer),,$set(composer,$if2"
"(%lyricist%,%writer%,%arranger%)))\n"
"\n"
"这仅在 MusicBrainz 未提供作曲家信息时，才从其他字段设置作曲家，\n"
"无论文件最初带有何种作曲家标签。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 3.0 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:424
msgid "$get_original(name)"
msgstr "$get_original(name)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:426
msgid ""
"Returns the value of the variable `name` from the file's original metadata\n"
"only, ignoring values from MusicBrainz or scripts.\n"
"\n"
"This is useful to access the file's existing tag values regardless of what\n"
"MusicBrainz has provided.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $set(comment,Original artist was: $get_original(artist))\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 3.0_"
msgstr ""
"仅从文件的原始元数据中返回变量 `name` 的值，\n"
"忽略来自 MusicBrainz 或脚本的值。\n"
"\n"
"这有助于访问文件现有的标签值，而无论\n"
"MusicBrainz 提供了什么。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $set(comment,原始艺术家：$get_original(artist))\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 3.0 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:445
msgid "$copy(new,old)"
msgstr "$copy(new,old)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:447
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Copies metadata from variable `old` to `new`.\n"
"The difference between `$set(new,%old%)` is that `$copy(new,old)` copies\n"
"    multi-value variables without flattening them.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 0.9_"
msgstr ""
"将变量 `old` 中的元数据复制到 `new` 中。\n"
"与 `$set(new,%old%)` 的区别在于，`$copy(new,old)` 会复制\n"
"    多值变量，而不会将其展平。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 0.9 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:462
msgid "$copymerge(new,old[,keep_duplicates])"
msgstr "$copymerge(new,old[,keep_duplicates])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:464
msgid ""
"Merges metadata from variable `old` into `new`, removing duplicates and\n"
"    appending to the end, so retaining the original ordering. Like `$copy`, "
"this\n"
"    will also copy multi-valued variables without flattening them.\n"
"\n"
"If `keep_duplicates` is set, then the duplicates will not be removed from "
"the result.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 1.0_"
msgstr ""
"将变量 `old` 中的元数据合并到 `new` 中，去除重复项并\n"
"    追加到末尾，从而保留原始顺序。与 `$copy` 类似，此操作\n"
"    也会复制多值变量，而不会将其展平。\n"
"\n"
"如果设置了 `keep_duplicates`，则结果中不会移除重复项。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 1.0 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:483
msgid "$trim(text[,char])"
msgstr "$trim(text[,char])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:485
msgid ""
"Trims all leading and trailing whitespaces from `text`.\n"
"    The optional second parameter `char` specifies the character to trim."
msgstr ""
"从 `text` 中去除所有开头和结尾的空格。\n"
"    可选的第二个参数 `char` 指定要去除的字符。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:498
msgid ""
"Add `y` to `x`.\n"
"Can be used with an arbitrary number of arguments.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $add(x,y,z) = ((x + y) + z)\n"
msgstr ""
"将 `y` 加到 `x` 上。\n"
"可与任意数量的参数一起使用。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $add(x,y,z) = ((x + y) + z)\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:516
msgid ""
"Subtracts `y` from `x`.\n"
"Can be used with an arbitrary number of arguments.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $sub(x,y,z) = ((x - y) - z)\n"
msgstr ""
"从 `x` 中减去 `y`。\n"
"可与任意数量的参数一起使用。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $sub(x,y,z) = ((x - y) - z)\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:534
msgid ""
"Divides `x` by `y`.\n"
"Can be used with an arbitrary number of arguments.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $div(x,y,z) = ((x / y) / z)\n"
msgstr ""
"将 `x` 除以 `y`。\n"
"可与任意数量的参数一起使用。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $div(x,y,z) = ((x / y) / z)\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:554
msgid ""
"Returns the remainder of `x` divided by `y`.\n"
"Can be used with an arbitrary number of arguments.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $mod(x,y,z) = ((x % y) % z)\n"
msgstr ""
"返回 `x` 除以 `y` 的余数。\n"
"可与任意数量的参数一起使用。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $mod(x,y,z) = ((x % y) % z)\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:572
msgid ""
"Multiplies `x` by `y`.\n"
"Can be used with an arbitrary number of arguments.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $mul(x,y,z) = ((x * y) * z)\n"
msgstr ""
"将 `x` 与 `y` 相乘。\n"
"可与任意数量的参数一起使用。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $mul(x,y,z) = ((x * y) * z)\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:590
msgid ""
"Returns true if either `x` or `y` not empty.\n"
"    Can be used with an arbitrary number of arguments.\n"
"    The result is true if **any** of the arguments is not empty."
msgstr ""
"如果 `x` 或 `y` 中的任意一个不为空，则返回 true。\n"
"    可与任意数量的参数一起使用。\n"
"    只要参数中**任意一个**不为空，结果即为 true。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:604
msgid ""
"Returns true if both `x` and `y` are not empty.\n"
"    Can be used with an arbitrary number of arguments.\n"
"    The result is true if **all** of the arguments are not empty."
msgstr ""
"如果 `x` 和 `y` 均不为空，则返回 true。\n"
"    可与任意数量的参数一起使用。\n"
"    如果**所有**参数均不为空，则结果为 true。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:617
msgid "Returns true if `x` is empty."
msgstr "如果 `x` 为空，则返回 true。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:627
msgid "Returns true if `x` equals `y`."
msgstr "如果 `x` 等于 `y`，则返回 true。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:637
msgid "Returns true if `x` does not equal `y`."
msgstr "如果 `x` 不等于 `y`，则返回 true。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:680
msgid "$lt(x,y[,type])"
msgstr "$lt(x,y[,type])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:682
msgid ""
"Returns true if `x` is less than `y` using the comparison specified in "
"`type`.\n"
"Possible values of `type` are \"int\" (integer), \"float\" (floating point), "
"\"text\"\n"
"(case-sensitive text), \"nocase\" (case-insensitive text) and \"auto\" "
"(automatically\n"
"determine the type of arguments provided), with \"auto\" used as the "
"default\n"
"comparison method if `type` is not specified.  The \"auto\" type will use "
"the\n"
"first type that applies to both arguments in the following order of "
"preference:\n"
"\"int\", \"float\" and \"text\"."
msgstr ""
"如果 `x` 小于 `y`（使用 `type` 中指定的比较方式），则返回 true。\n"
"`type` 的可能取值为 \"int\"（整数）、\"float\"（浮点数）、\"text\"\n"
"（区分大小写的文本）、\"nocase\"（不区分大小写的文本）和 \"auto\"（自动\n"
"确定所提供参数的类型），若未指定 `type`，则默认使用 \"auto\"\n"
"作为比较方法。  “auto”类型将使用\n"
"按以下优先级顺序中，第一个同时适用于两个参数的类型：\n"
"“int”、“float”和“text”。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:696
msgid "$lte(x,y[,type])"
msgstr "$lte(x,y[,type])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:698
msgid ""
"Returns true if `x` is less than or equal to `y` using the comparison "
"specified in `type`.\n"
"Possible values of `type` are \"int\" (integer), \"float\" (floating point), "
"\"text\"\n"
"(case-sensitive text), \"nocase\" (case-insensitive text) and \"auto\" "
"(automatically\n"
"determine the type of arguments provided), with \"auto\" used as the "
"default\n"
"comparison method if `type` is not specified.  The \"auto\" type will use "
"the\n"
"first type that applies to both arguments in the following order of "
"preference:\n"
"\"int\", \"float\" and \"text\"."
msgstr ""
"如果 `x` 小于或等于 `y`（使用 `type` 中指定的比较方式），则返回 true。\n"
"`type` 的可能取值为 \"int\"（整数）、\"float\"（浮点数）、\"text\"\n"
"（区分大小写的文本）、\"nocase\"（不区分大小写的文本）和 \"auto\"（自动\n"
"确定所提供参数的类型），若未指定 `type`，则默认使用 \"auto\"\n"
"作为比较方法。  “auto”类型将使用\n"
"按以下优先级顺序中，第一个同时适用于两个参数的类型：\n"
"“int”、“float”和“text”。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:712
msgid "$gt(x,y[,type])"
msgstr "$gt(x,y[,type])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:714
msgid ""
"Returns true if `x` is greater than `y` using the comparison specified in "
"`type`.\n"
"Possible values of `type` are \"int\" (integer), \"float\" (floating point), "
"\"text\"\n"
"(case-sensitive text), \"nocase\" (case-insensitive text) and \"auto\" "
"(automatically\n"
"determine the type of arguments provided), with \"auto\" used as the "
"default\n"
"comparison method if `type` is not specified.  The \"auto\" type will use "
"the\n"
"first type that applies to both arguments in the following order of "
"preference:\n"
"\"int\", \"float\" and \"text\"."
msgstr ""
"如果 `x` 大于 `y`（使用 `type` 中指定的比较方式），则返回 true。\n"
"`type` 的可能取值为 \"int\"（整数）、\"float\"（浮点数）、\"text\"\n"
"（区分大小写的文本）、\"nocase\"（不区分大小写的文本）和 \"auto\"（自动\n"
"确定所提供参数的类型），若未指定 `type`，则默认使用 \"auto\"\n"
"作为比较方法。  “auto”类型将使用\n"
"第一个同时适用于两个参数的类型，优先顺序如下：\n"
"“int”、“float”和“text”。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:728
msgid "$gte(x,y[,type])"
msgstr "$gte(x,y[,type])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:730
msgid ""
"Returns true if `x` is greater than or equal to `y` using the comparison "
"specified in `type`.\n"
"Possible values of `type` are \"int\" (integer), \"float\" (floating point), "
"\"text\"\n"
"(case-sensitive text), \"nocase\" (case-insensitive text) and \"auto\" "
"(automatically\n"
"determine the type of arguments provided), with \"auto\" used as the "
"default\n"
"comparison method if `type` is not specified.  The \"auto\" type will use "
"the\n"
"first type that applies to both arguments in the following order of "
"preference:\n"
"\"int\", \"float\" and \"text\"."
msgstr ""
"如果 `x` 根据 `type` 中指定的比较方式大于或等于 `y`，则返回 true。\n"
"`type` 的可能取值为 \"int\"（整数）、\"float\"（浮点数）、\"text\"\n"
"（区分大小写的文本）、\"nocase\"（不区分大小写的文本）和 \"auto\"（自动\n"
"确定所提供参数的类型），若未指定 `type`，则默认使用 \"auto\"\n"
"作为比较方法。  “auto”类型将使用\n"
"按以下优先级顺序中，第一个同时适用于两个参数的类型：\n"
"“int”、“float”和“text”。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:744
msgid "$len(text)"
msgstr "$len(text)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:745
msgid "Returns the number of characters in `text`."
msgstr "返回 `text` 中的字符数。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:753
msgid "$lenmulti(name[,separator=; ])"
msgstr "$lenmulti(name[,separator=; ])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:755
msgid ""
"Returns the number of elements in the multi-value tag `name`. A literal "
"value\n"
"    representing a multi-value can be substituted for `name`, using the\n"
"    `separator` (or \"; \" if not passed) to coerce the value into a proper\n"
"    multi-valued tag.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $lenmulti(One; Two; Three) = 3\n"
msgstr ""
"返回多值标签 `name` 中的元素个数。可以用一个\n"
"    表示多值的字面量来替换 `name`，并使用\n"
"    `separator`（若未传入，则使用“; ”）将该值转换为正确的\n"
"    多值标签。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $lenmulti(One; Two; Three) = 3\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:771
msgid "$performer([pattern[,join=, ]])"
msgstr "$performer([pattern[,join=, ]])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:773
msgid ""
"Returns the performers where the performance type (e.g. \"vocal\") matches "
"`pattern`, joined by `join`.\n"
"You can specify a regular expression in the format `/pattern/flags`. `flags` "
"are optional. Currently\n"
"the only supported flag is \"i\" (ignore case). For example `$performer(/"
"^guitars?$/i)` matches the\n"
"performance type \"guitar\" or \"Guitars\", but not e.g. \"bass guitar\".\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 0.10_"
msgstr ""
"返回表演类型（例如“vocal”）与 `pattern` 匹配的表演者，并使用 `join` 进行连接"
"。\n"
"您可以以 `/pattern/flags` 的格式指定正则表达式。`flags` 是可选的。目前\n"
"唯一支持的标志是“i”（忽略大小写）。 例如，`$performer(/^guitars?$/i)` 会匹"
"配\n"
"表演类型“guitar”或“Guitars”，但不会匹配例如“bass guitar”。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 0.10 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:798
msgid ""
"Returns the number of matched tracks within a release.\n"
"    **Only works in File Naming scripts.**\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 0.12_"
msgstr ""
"返回某张专辑中匹配到的曲目数量。\n"
"    **仅在文件命名脚本中有效。**\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 0.12 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:814
msgid ""
"Returns true if every track in the album is matched to a single file.\n"
"**Only works in File Naming scripts.**"
msgstr ""
"如果专辑中的每首曲目都与单个文件匹配，则返回 true。\n"
"**仅在“文件命名”脚本中有效。**"

#: picard/script/functions.py:833
msgid "$firstalphachar(text[,nonalpha=#])"
msgstr "$firstalphachar(text[,nonalpha=#])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:835
msgid ""
"Returns the first character of `text`.\n"
"If `text` does not begin with an alphabetic character, then `nonalpha` is "
"returned instead. If `nonalpha` is not\n"
"specified, the default value \"#\" will be used.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 0.12_"
msgstr ""
"返回 `text` 的第一个字符。\n"
"如果 `text` 不是以字母开头的，则返回 `nonalpha`。如果未指定 `nonalpha`，\n"
"则使用默认值“#”。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 0.12 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:853
msgid "$initials(text)"
msgstr "$initials(text)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:855
msgid ""
"Returns the first character of each word in `text`, if it is an alphabetic "
"character.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 0.12_"
msgstr ""
"返回 `text` 中每个单词的首个字符，前提是该字符为字母。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 0.12 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:865
msgid "$firstwords(text,length)"
msgstr "$firstwords(text,length)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:867
msgid ""
"Like `$truncate()` except that it will only return the complete words from "
"`text` which fit within `length` characters.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 0.12_"
msgstr ""
"与 `$truncate()` 类似，但它只会返回 `text` 中那些长度不超过 `length` 个字符的"
"完整单词。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 0.12 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:889
msgid "$startswith(text,prefix)"
msgstr "$startswith(text,prefix)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:891
msgid ""
"Returns true if `text` starts with `prefix`.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 1.4_"
msgstr ""
"如果 `text` 以 `prefix` 开头，则返回 true。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 1.4 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:903
msgid "$endswith(text,suffix)"
msgstr "$endswith(text,suffix)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:905
msgid ""
"Returns true if `text` ends with `suffix`.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 1.4_"
msgstr ""
"如果 `text` 以 `suffix` 结尾，则返回 true。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 1.4 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:917
msgid "$truncate(text,length)"
msgstr "$truncate(text,length)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:919
msgid ""
"Truncate `text` to `length`.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 0.12_"
msgstr ""
"将 `text` 截断为 `length`。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 0.12 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:934
msgid "$swapprefix(text,prefix1,prefix2,…)"
msgstr "$swapprefix(text,prefix1,prefix2,…)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:936
msgid ""
"Moves the specified prefixes from the beginning to the end of `text`. "
"Multiple\n"
"prefixes can be specified as separate parameters. If no prefix is specified "
"'A'\n"
"and 'The' are used by default.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $swapprefix(%albumartist%,A,An,The,La,Le,Les,Un,Une)\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 1.3, previously as a plugin since Picard 0.13_"
msgstr ""
"将指定的前缀从 `text` 的开头移至结尾。可以\n"
"将多个前缀作为单独的参数指定。如果未指定前缀，则默认使用 'A'\n"
"和 'The'。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $swapprefix(%albumartist%,A,An,The,La,Le,Les,Un,Une)\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 1.3 起提供，此前自 Picard 0.13 起作为插件提供_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:958
msgid "$delprefix(text,prefix1,prefix2,…)"
msgstr "$delprefix(text,prefix1,prefix2,…)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:960
msgid ""
"Deletes the specified prefixes from the beginning of `text`. Multiple\n"
"prefixes can be specified as separate parameters.  If no prefix is specified "
"'A'\n"
"and 'The' are used by default.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $delprefix(%albumartist%,A,An,The,La,Le,Les,Un,Une)\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 1.3_"
msgstr ""
"从 `text` 的开头删除指定的前缀。可以\n"
"将多个前缀作为单独的参数指定。如果未指定前缀，则默认使用 'A'\n"
"和 'The'。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $delprefix(%albumartist%,A,An,The,La,Le,Les,Un,Une)\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 1.3 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:998
msgid "$eq_any(x,a1,a2,…)"
msgstr "$eq_any(x,a1,a2,…)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1000
msgid ""
"Returns true if `x` equals `a1` or `a2` or …\n"
"Functionally equivalent to `$or($eq(x,a1),$eq(x,a2),…)`.\n"
"Functionally equivalent to the eq2 plugin."
msgstr ""
"如果 `x` 等于 `a1` 或 `a2` 或 …，则返回 true。\n"
"功能上等同于 `$or($eq(x,a1),$eq(x,a2),…)`。\n"
"功能上等同于 eq2 插件。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1012
msgid "$ne_all(x,a1,a2,…)"
msgstr "$ne_all(x,a1,a2,…)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1014
msgid ""
"Returns true if `x` does not equal `a1` and `a2` and …\n"
"Functionally equivalent to `$and($ne(x,a1),$ne(x,a2),…)`.\n"
"Functionally equivalent to the ne2 plugin."
msgstr ""
"如果 `x` 不等于 `a1`、`a2` 以及……，则返回 true。\n"
"功能上等同于 `$and($ne(x,a1),$ne(x,a2),…)`。\n"
"功能上等同于 ne2 插件。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1026
msgid "$eq_all(x,a1,a2,…)"
msgstr "$eq_all(x,a1,a2,…)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1028
msgid ""
"Returns true if `x` equals `a1` and `a2` and …\n"
"Functionally equivalent to `$and($eq(x,a1),$eq(x,a2),…)`.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $if($eq_all(%albumartist%,%artist%,Justin Bieber),$set(engineer,Meat "
"Loaf))\n"
msgstr ""
"如果 `x` 同时等于 `a1`、`a2` 和……，则返回 true。\n"
"其功能等同于 `$and($eq(x,a1),$eq(x,a2),…)`。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $if($eq_all(%albumartist%,%artist%,Justin Bieber),$set(engineer,Meat "
"Loaf))\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1046
msgid "$ne_any(x,a1,a2,…)"
msgstr "$ne_any(x,a1,a2,…)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1048
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Returns true if `x` does not equal `a1` or `a2` or …\n"
"Functionally equivalent to `$or($ne(x,a1),$ne(x,a2),…)`.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $if($ne_any(%albumartist%,%trackartist%,%composer%),$set(lyricist,"
"%composer%))\n"
msgstr ""
"如果 `x` 不等于 `a1` 或 `a2` 或 …，则返回 true。\n"
"在功能上等同于 `$or($ne(x,a1),$ne(x,a2),…)`。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $if($ne_any(%albumartist%,%trackartist%,%composer%),$set"
"(lyricist,%composer%))\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1062
msgid "$title(text)"
msgstr "$title(text)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1064
msgid ""
"Returns `text` in title case (first character in every word capitalized).\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $set(album,$title(%album%))\n"
"_Since Picard 2.1_"
msgstr ""
"将 `text` 转换为标题格式（每个单词的首字母大写）。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $set(album,$title(%album%))\n"
"_自 Picard 2.1 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1078
msgid ""
"Returns true, if the file processed is an audio file.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 2.2_"
msgstr ""
"如果处理的文件是音频文件，则返回 true。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 2.2 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1092
msgid ""
"Returns true, if the file processed is a video file.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 2.2_"
msgstr ""
"如果处理的文件是视频文件，则返回 true。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 2.2 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1105
msgid "$find(haystack,needle)"
msgstr "$find(haystack,needle)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1107
msgid ""
"Finds the location of one string within another.\n"
"    Returns the index of the first occurrence of `needle` in `haystack`, or "
"\"\" if `needle` was not found.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 2.3_\n"
"\n"
"Note that prior to Picard 2.3.2 `$find` returned \"-1\" if `needle` was not "
"found."
msgstr ""
"查找一个字符串在另一个字符串中的位置。\n"
"    返回 `needle` 在 `haystack` 中首次出现的位置索引；如果未找到 `needle`，则"
"返回 \"\"。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 2.3 起_\n"
"\n"
"请注意，在 Picard 2.3.2 之前，如果未找到 `needle`，`$find` 会返回 \"-1\"。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1123
msgid "$reverse(text)"
msgstr "$reverse(text)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1124
msgid "Returns `text` in reverse order."
msgstr "按反向顺序返回 `text`。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1131
msgid "$substr(text,start[,end])"
msgstr "$substr(text,start[,end])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1133
msgid ""
"Returns the substring beginning with the character at the `start` index, up "
"to\n"
"    (but not including) the character at the `end` index. Indexes are\n"
"    zero-based. Negative numbers will be counted back from the end of the\n"
"    string. If the `start` or `end` indexes are left blank, they will "
"default to\n"
"    the start and end of the string respectively."
msgstr ""
"返回从索引 `start` 处的字符开始，到\n"
"    索引 `end` 处的字符（不包括该字符）为止的子字符串。索引\n"
"    从 0 开始。 负数将从字符串末尾\n"
"    开始倒数。如果 `start` 或 `end` 索引留空，它们将默认分别\n"
"    设置为字符串的开头和结尾。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1154
msgid "$getmulti(name,index[,separator=; ])"
msgstr "$getmulti(name,index[,separator=; ])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1156
msgid ""
"Gets the element at `index` from the multi-value tag `name`. A literal "
"value\n"
"    representing a multi-value can be substituted for `name`, using the\n"
"    separator (or \"; \" if not passed) to coerce the value into a proper\n"
"    multi-valued tag."
msgstr ""
"从多值标签 `name` 中获取位于 `index` 处的元素。可以将一个\n"
"    表示多值的字面量替换为 `name`，并使用\n"
"    分隔符（若未传入，则使用“; ”）将该值转换为正确的\n"
"    多值标签。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1175
msgid "$foreach(name,code[,separator=; ])"
msgstr "$foreach(name,code[,separator=; ])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1177
msgid ""
"Iterates over each element found in the multi-value tag `name`, executing\n"
"    `code`. For each loop, the element value is first stored in the tag\n"
"    `_loop_value` and the count is stored in the tag `_loop_count`. This "
"allows\n"
"    the element or count value to be accessed within the `code` script. A\n"
"    literal value representing a multi-value can be substituted for `name`,\n"
"    using the separator (or \"; \" if not passed) to coerce the value into "
"a\n"
"    proper multi-valued tag."
msgstr ""
"遍历多值标签 `name` 中找到的每个元素，并执行\n"
"    `code`。在每次循环中，元素值首先存储在标签\n"
"    `_loop_value` 中，计数则存储在标签 `_loop_count` 中。 这使得\n"
"    可以在 `code` 脚本中访问该元素或计数值。一个\n"
"    表示多值的字面量可以替换 `name`，\n"
"    使用分隔符（若未传入则使用“; ”）将该值转换为\n"
"    正确的多值标签。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1199
msgid "$while(condition,code)"
msgstr "$while(condition,code)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1201
msgid ""
"Standard 'while' loop. Executes `code` repeatedly until `condition` no "
"longer\n"
"    evaluates to `True`. For each loop, the count is stored in the tag\n"
"    `_loop_count`. This allows the count value to be accessed within the "
"`code`\n"
"    script. The function limits the maximum number of iterations to 1000 as "
"a\n"
"    safeguard against accidentally creating an infinite loop."
msgstr ""
"标准的“while”循环。反复执行 `code`，直到 `condition` 的\n"
"    评估结果不再为 `True` 为止。每次循环时，计数值都会存储在标签\n"
"    `_loop_count` 中。这样就可以在 `code`\n"
"    脚本内部访问该计数值。 该函数将最大迭代次数限制为 1000，作为\n"
"    一项安全措施，以防止意外产生无限循环。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1222
msgid "$map(name,code[,separator=; ])"
msgstr "$map(name,code[,separator=; ])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1224
msgid ""
"Iterates over each element found in the multi-value tag `name` and updates "
"the\n"
"    value of the element to the value returned by `code`, returning the "
"updated\n"
"    multi-value tag. For each loop, the element value is first stored in the "
"tag\n"
"    `_loop_value` and the count is stored in the tag `_loop_count`. This "
"allows\n"
"    the element or count value to be accessed within the `code` script.\n"
"\n"
"Empty elements are automatically removed.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $map(First:A; Second:B,$upper(%_loop_count%=%_loop_value%))\n"
"\n"
"Result: 1=FIRST:A; 2=SECOND:B\n"
msgstr ""
"遍历多值标签 `name` 中找到的每个元素，并将\n"
"    该元素的值更新为 `code` 返回的值，最后返回更新后的\n"
"    多值标签。 在每次循环中，元素值首先存储在标签\n"
"    `_loop_value` 中，计数则存储在标签 `_loop_count` 中。这使得\n"
"    可以在 `code` 脚本中访问元素或计数值。\n"
"\n"
"空元素会被自动移除。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $map(First:A; Second:B,$upper(%_loop_count%=%_loop_value%))\n"
"\n"
"结果：1=FIRST:A; 2=SECOND:B\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1254
msgid "$join(name,text[,separator=; ])"
msgstr "$join(name,text[,separator=; ])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1256
msgid ""
"Joins all elements in `name`, placing `text` between each element, and "
"returns the result as a string."
msgstr ""
"将 `name` 中的所有元素连接起来，在每个元素之间插入 `text`，并将结果作为字符串"
"返回。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1267
msgid "$slice(name,start,end[,separator=; ])"
msgstr "$slice(name,start,end[,separator=; ])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1269
msgid ""
"Returns a multi-value variable containing the elements between the `start` "
"and\n"
"    `end` indexes from the multi-value tag `name`. A literal value "
"representing\n"
"    a multi-value can be substituted for `name`, using the separator (or \"; "
"\" if\n"
"    not passed) to coerce the value into a proper multi-valued tag. Indexes "
"are\n"
"    zero based. Negative numbers will be counted back from the end of the "
"list.\n"
"    If the `start` or `end` indexes are left blank, they will default to "
"the\n"
"    start and end of the list respectively.\n"
"\n"
"The following example will create a multi-value variable with all artists\n"
"    in `%artists%` except the first, which can be used to create a \"feat.\" "
"list.\n"
"\n"
"Examples:\n"
"\n"
"    $setmulti(supporting_artists,$slice(%artists%,1))\n"
"    $setmulti(supporting_artists,$slice(%artists%,1,-1))\n"
msgstr ""
"返回一个多值变量，其中包含多值标签 `name` 中位于 `start` 和\n"
"    `end` 索引之间的元素。 可以用表示\n"
"    多值字面量来替换 `name`，使用分隔符（若未传入则使用\n"
"    “; ”）将该值转换为正确的多值标签。索引从\n"
"    零开始。负数将从列表末尾倒数。\n"
"    如果 `start` 或 `end` 索引留空，它们将分别默认设置为\n"
"    列表的起始位置和末尾位置。\n"
"\n"
"以下示例将创建一个多值变量，其中包含 `%artists%` 中\n"
"    除第一个以外的所有艺术家，该变量可用于创建“feat.”列表。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $setmulti(supporting_artists,$slice(%artists%,1))\n"
"    $setmulti(supporting_artists,$slice(%artists%,1,-1))\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1301
#, python-format
msgid "$datetime([format=%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S])"
msgstr "$datetime([format=%Y-%m-%d %H:%M:%S])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1303
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Returns the current date and time in the specified `format`, which is based "
"on\n"
"    the standard Python `strftime` [format codes](https://strftime.org/). If "
"no\n"
"    `format` is specified the date/time will be returned in the form\n"
"    `2020-02-05 14:26:32`.\n"
"Note: Platform-specific formatting codes should be avoided to help ensure "
"the\n"
"    portability of scripts across the different platforms.  These codes "
"include:\n"
"    remove zero-padding (e.g. `%-d` and `%-m` on Linux or macOS, and their\n"
"    equivalent `%#d` and `%#m` on Windows); element length specifiers (e.g.\n"
"    `%3Y`); and hanging '%' at the end of the format string."
msgstr ""
"返回以指定 `format` 格式显示的当前日期和时间，该格式基于\n"
"    Python 标准 `strftime` [格式代码](https://strftime.org/)。如果未\n"
"    指定 `format`，则日期/时间将以\n"
"    `2020-02-05 14:26:32`。\n"
"注意：应避免使用特定于平台的格式代码，以确保\n"
"    脚本在不同平台间的可移植性。  这些代码包括：\n"
"    去除零填充（例如 Linux 或 macOS 上的 `%-d` 和 `%-m`，以及 Windows 上的\n"
"    等效代码 `%#d` 和 `%#m`）；元素长度指定符（例如\n"
"    `%3Y`）；以及格式字符串末尾的悬挂“%”符号。"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1327
msgid "$sortmulti(name[,separator=; ])"
msgstr "$sortmulti(name[,separator=; ])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1329
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the multi-value tag `name` with the elements sorted in "
"ascending order.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $sortmulti(B; A; C)\n"
"\n"
"Result: A; B; C\n"
msgstr ""
"返回多值标签 `name` 的副本，其中各元素按升序排列。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $sortmulti(B; A; C)\n"
"\n"
"结果：A; B; C\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1346
msgid "$reversemulti(name[,separator=; ])"
msgstr "$reversemulti(name[,separator=; ])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1348
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the multi-value tag `name` with the elements in reverse "
"order.\n"
"    This can be used in conjunction with the `$sortmulti` function to sort "
"in\n"
"    descending order.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $reversemulti($sortmulti(B; A; C))\n"
"\n"
"Result: C; B; A\n"
msgstr ""
"返回多值标签 `name` 的副本，其中元素顺序被反转。\n"
"    这可以与 `$sortmulti` 函数结合使用，以\n"
"    降序进行排序。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $reversemulti($sortmulti(B; A; C))\n"
"\n"
"结果：C; B; A\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1367
msgid "$unique(name[,case_sensitive[,separator=; ]])"
msgstr "$unique(name[,case_sensitive[,separator=; ]])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1369
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Returns a copy of the multi-value tag `name` with no duplicate elements.\n"
"    By default, a case-insensitive comparison of the elements is performed.\n"
"\n"
"Example 1:\n"
"\n"
"    $setmulti(foo,a; A; B; b; cd; Cd; cD; CD; a; A; b)\n"
"    $unique(%foo%)\n"
"\n"
"Result: A; CD; b\n"
"\n"
"Example 2:\n"
"\n"
"    $setmulti(foo,a; A; B; b; a; b; A; B, cd)\n"
"    $unique(%foo%,True)\n"
"\n"
"Result: A; B; a; b; cd\n"
msgstr ""
"返回多值标签 `name` 的副本，其中不包含重复元素。\n"
"    默认情况下，对元素进行不区分大小写的比较。\n"
"\n"
"示例 1：\n"
"\n"
"    $setmulti(foo,a; A; B; b; cd; Cd; cD; CD; a; A; b)\n"
"    $unique(%foo%)\n"
"\n"
"结果：A; CD; b\n"
"\n"
"示例 2：\n"
"\n"
"    $setmulti(foo,a; A; B; b; a; b; A; B, cd)\n"
"    $unique(%foo%,True)\n"
"\n"
"结果：A; B; a; b; cd\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1396
msgid "$countryname(country_code[,translate])"
msgstr "$countryname(country_code[,translate])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1398
msgid ""
"Returns the name of the country for the specified country code. If the "
"country code is invalid an empty string will be returned.\n"
"If `translate` is not blank, the output will be translated into the current "
"locale language.\n"
msgstr ""
"返回指定国家代码对应的国家名称。如果国家代码无效，则返回空字符串。\n"
"如果 `translate` 不为空，则输出内容将翻译成当前区域设置的语言。\n"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1436
msgid "$year(date[,date_order=ymd])"
msgstr "$year(date[,date_order=ymd])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1438
msgid ""
"Returns the year portion of the specified date.  The default order is "
"\"ymd\".  This can be changed by specifying\n"
"either \"dmy\" or \"mdy\".  If the date is invalid an empty string will be "
"returned.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 2.7_"
msgstr ""
"返回指定日期的年份部分。默认格式为“ymd”。可通过指定\n"
"“dmy”或“mdy”来更改该格式。如果日期无效，则返回空字符串。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 2.7 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1449
msgid "$month(date[,date_order=ymd])"
msgstr "$month(date[,date_order=ymd])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1451
msgid ""
"Returns the month portion of the specified date.  The default order is "
"\"ymd\".  This can be changed by specifying\n"
"either \"dmy\" or \"mdy\".  If the date is invalid an empty string will be "
"returned.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 2.7_"
msgstr ""
"返回指定日期的月份部分。默认顺序为“ymd”。可通过指定\n"
"“dmy”或“mdy”来更改此顺序。如果日期无效，则返回空字符串。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 2.7 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1462
msgid "$day(date[,date_order=ymd])"
msgstr "$day(date[,date_order=ymd])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1464
msgid ""
"Returns the day portion of the specified date.  The default order is "
"\"ymd\".  This can be changed by specifying\n"
"either \"dmy\" or \"mdy\".  If the date is invalid an empty string will be "
"returned.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 2.7_"
msgstr ""
"返回指定日期的日期部分。默认顺序为“ymd”。可通过指定\n"
"“dmy”或“mdy”来更改此顺序。如果日期无效，则返回空字符串。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 2.7 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1475
#, python-format
msgid "$dateformat(date[,format=%Y-%m-%d[,date_order=ymd]])"
msgstr "$dateformat(date[,format=%Y-%m-%d[,date_order=ymd]])"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1477
#, python-format
msgid ""
"Returns the input date in the specified `format`, which is based on the "
"standard\n"
"    Python `strftime` [format codes](https://strftime.org/). If no `format` "
"is\n"
"    specified the date will be returned in the form `2020-02-05`.  If the "
"date or\n"
"    format are invalid an empty string will be returned.\n"
"\n"
"    The default order for the input date is \"ymd\".  This can be changed by "
"specifying\n"
"    either \"dmy\" or \"mdy\".\n"
"Note: Platform-specific formatting codes should be avoided to help ensure "
"the\n"
"    portability of scripts across the different platforms.  These codes "
"include:\n"
"    remove zero-padding (e.g. `%-d` and `%-m` on Linux or macOS, and their\n"
"    equivalent `%#d` and `%#m` on Windows); element length specifiers (e.g.\n"
"    `%3Y`); and hanging '%' at the end of the format string.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 2.7_"
msgstr ""
"返回以指定 `format` 格式显示的输入日期，该格式基于标准\n"
"    Python `strftime` [格式代码](https://strftime.org/)。如果未指定 "
"`format`，\n"
"    则日期将以 `2020-02-05` 的形式返回。  如果日期或\n"
"    格式无效，则返回空字符串。\n"
"\n"
"    输入日期的默认顺序为“ymd”。可以通过指定\n"
"    “dmy”或“mdy”来更改此顺序。\n"
"注意：应避免使用特定于平台的格式代码，以确保\n"
"    脚本在不同平台间的可移植性。这些代码包括：\n"
"    去除零填充（例如 Linux 或 macOS 上的 `%-d` 和 `%-m`，以及 Windows 上的\n"
"    等效代码 `%#d` 和 `%#m`）； 元素长度指定符（例如\n"
"    `%3Y`）；以及格式字符串末尾的悬挂“%”符号。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 2.7 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1510
msgid "$is_multi(name)"
msgstr "$is_multi(name)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1512
msgid ""
"Returns '1' if the argument is a multi-value tag and there are more than one "
"elements, otherwise an empty string.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $is_multi(%artists%)\n"
"\n"
"Result: 1 if there is more than one artist, otherwise \"\".\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 2.7_"
msgstr ""
"如果参数是一个多值标签且包含多个元素，则返回“1”；否则返回空字符串。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $is_multi(%artists%)\n"
"\n"
"结果：如果存在多个艺术家，则返回 1；否则返回 “”。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 2.7 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1530
msgid "$cleanmulti(name)"
msgstr "$cleanmulti(name)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1532
msgid ""
"Removes all empty string elements from the multi-value variable.\n"
"\n"
"Example:\n"
"\n"
"    $setmulti(test,one; ; two; three)\n"
"    $cleanmulti(test)\n"
"\n"
"Result: Sets the value of 'test' to [\"one\", \"two\", \"three\"].\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 2.8_"
msgstr ""
"从多值变量中移除所有空字符串元素。\n"
"\n"
"示例：\n"
"\n"
"    $setmulti(test,one; ; two; three)\n"
"    $cleanmulti(test)\n"
"\n"
"结果：将 'test' 的值设置为 [\"one\", \"two\", \"three\"]。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 2.8 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1601
msgid "$min(type,x,…)"
msgstr "$min(type,x,…)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1603
msgid ""
"Returns the minimum value using the comparison specified in `type`.\n"
"\n"
"Possible values of `type` are \"int\" (integer), \"float\" (floating point), "
"\"text\"\n"
"(case-sensitive text), \"nocase\" (case-insensitive text) and \"auto\" "
"(automatically\n"
"determine the type of arguments provided), with \"auto\" used as the "
"default\n"
"comparison method if `type` is not specified.  The \"auto\" type will use "
"the\n"
"first type that applies to both arguments in the following order of "
"preference:\n"
"\"int\", \"float\" and \"text\".\n"
"\n"
"Can be used with an arbitrary number of arguments.  Multi-value arguments\n"
"will be expanded automatically.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 2.9_"
msgstr ""
"使用 `type` 中指定的比较方式返回最小值。\n"
"\n"
"`type` 的可能取值为“int”（整数）、“float”（浮点数）、“text”\n"
"（区分大小写的文本）、\"nocase\"（不区分大小写的文本）和 \"auto\"（自动\n"
"确定所提供参数的类型），若未指定 `type`，则默认使用 \"auto\"\n"
"作为比较方法。  “auto”类型将使用\n"
"第一个同时适用于两个参数的类型，优先顺序如下：\n"
"“int”、“float”和“text”。\n"
"\n"
"可与任意数量的参数一起使用。多值参数\n"
"将被自动展开。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 2.9 起_"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1623
msgid "$max(type,x,…)"
msgstr "$max(type,x,…)"

#: picard/script/functions.py:1625
msgid ""
"Returns the maximum value using the comparison specified in `type`.\n"
"\n"
"Possible values of `type` are \"int\" (integer), \"float\" (floating point), "
"\"text\"\n"
"(case-sensitive text), \"nocase\" (case-insensitive text) and \"auto\" "
"(automatically\n"
"determine the type of arguments provided), with \"auto\" used as the "
"default\n"
"comparison method if `type` is not specified.  The \"auto\" type will use "
"the\n"
"first type that applies to both arguments in the following order of "
"preference:\n"
"\"int\", \"float\" and \"text\".\n"
"\n"
"Can be used with an arbitrary number of arguments.  Multi-value arguments\n"
"will be expanded automatically.\n"
"\n"
"_Since Picard 2.9_"
msgstr ""
"使用 `type` 中指定的比较方式返回最大值。\n"
"\n"
"`type` 的可能取值为“int”（整数）、“float”（浮点数）、“text”\n"
"（区分大小写的文本）、\"nocase\"（不区分大小写的文本）和 \"auto\"（自动\n"
"确定所提供参数的类型），若未指定 `type`，则默认使用 \"auto\"\n"
"作为比较方法。  “auto”类型将使用\n"
"第一个同时适用于两个参数的类型，优先顺序为：\n"
"“int”、“float”和“text”。\n"
"\n"
"可与任意数量的参数一起使用。多值参数\n"
"将被自动展开。\n"
"\n"
"_自 Picard 2.9 起_"

