#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:130
msgid "Welcome to MusicBrainz Picard"
msgstr "欢迎使用 MusicBrainz Picard"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:150
msgid ""
"<p>Picard helps you tag and organize your music collection using the "
"MusicBrainz database.</p><p>This wizard will help you configure a few "
"important settings before you get started. You can always change these later "
"in the Options dialog.</p>"
msgstr ""
"<p>Picard 借助 MusicBrainz 数据库，帮助您为音乐收藏添加标签并进行整理。在开始"
"使用之前，</p><p>此向导将帮助您配置一些重要设置。您随时可以在\"选项\"对话框中"
"更改这些设置。</p>"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:162
msgid "Read the documentation"
msgstr "阅读文档"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:178
msgid "File Organization"
msgstr "文件组织"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:179
msgid ""
"Choose whether Picard should rename and move your files when saving tags."
msgstr "请选择是否让 Picard 在保存标签时重命名并移动您的文件。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:184
msgid "Rename files based on tags (e.g. \"Artist - Title.mp3\")"
msgstr "根据标签重命名文件（例如“艺术家 - 歌曲名称.mp3”）"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:185
msgid ""
"When you save tagged files, their filenames will be updated based on the new "
"tags."
msgstr "保存已添加标签的文件时，其文件名将根据新标签进行更新。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:190
msgid "Move files to a folder structure based on tags"
msgstr "根据标签将文件移动到相应的文件夹结构中"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:191
msgid ""
"Saved files will be organized into subfolders (e.g. Artist/Album/) inside "
"the folder you choose below."
msgstr ""
"保存的文件将按您在下文选择的文件夹内的子文件夹（例如 Artist/Album/）进行整理"
"。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:212
msgid ""
"You can change these later from the Options menu or under Options → Options "
"→ File Naming."
msgstr "您可以稍后通过“选项”菜单，或进入“选项”→“选项”→“文件命名”来更改这些设置。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:235
msgid "Destination folder required"
msgstr "必须指定目标文件夹"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:236
msgid ""
"Please choose a destination folder for your music files, or uncheck the move "
"files option."
msgstr "请选择音乐文件的保存位置，或者取消勾选“移动文件”选项。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:248
msgid "Select destination directory"
msgstr "选择目标目录"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:261
msgid "Choose how Picard should handle album cover art."
msgstr "请选择 Picard 应如何处理专辑封面。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:266
msgid "Embed cover art into audio files"
msgstr "将封面图嵌入音频文件"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:267
msgid ""
"The cover image will be stored inside the audio file itself, so it shows up "
"in any music player."
msgstr "封面图片将存储在音频文件内部，因此可在任何音乐播放器中显示。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:272
msgid "Save cover art as separate image files"
msgstr "将封面图另存为单独的图片文件"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:273
msgid ""
"A cover image file (e.g. cover.jpg) will be saved alongside your audio files "
"in the same folder."
msgstr "封面图片文件（例如 cover.jpg）将与您的音频文件一起保存在同一文件夹中。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:278
msgid "Prefer release group cover art"
msgstr "优先选用发行组的封面图"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:280
msgid ""
"Use the album's main cover art instead of edition-specific artwork. This "
"usually provides higher quality images but may not match your exact release."
msgstr ""
"请使用专辑的主封面图，而非特定版本的封面图。这样通常能获得更高质量的图片，但"
"可能与您的具体版本不完全一致。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:288
msgid "You can change these later under Options → Options → Cover Art."
msgstr "您稍后可以在“选项”→“选项”→“封面图”中进行更改。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:369
msgid "Updates"
msgstr "更新"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:370
msgid "Choose how Picard should check for updates."
msgstr "选择 Picard 应如何检查更新。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:382
msgid ""
"Check for a new program version online and show an update dialog if "
"available."
msgstr "在线检查是否有新版本的程序，如有可用版本，则显示更新对话框。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:390
msgid ""
"Check for plugin updates online and show a notification in the status bar."
msgstr "在线检查插件更新，并在状态栏中显示通知。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:398
msgid ""
"Check for available documentation translations, so the online help can be "
"shown in your language."
msgstr "请查看可用的文档翻译，以便在线帮助能以您的语言显示。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:404
msgid "You can change these later under Options → General → Startup."
msgstr "您稍后可以在“选项”→“常规”→“启动”中更改这些设置。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:438
msgid "Additional Metadata"
msgstr "附加元数据"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:439
msgid "Choose whether Picard should fetch extra details about each track."
msgstr "选择是否让 Picard 获取每首曲目的更多详细信息。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:444
msgid "Fetch detailed track relationships (performers, composers, and more)"
msgstr "获取曲目详细关联信息（演唱者、作曲者等）"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:446
msgid ""
"For every track, Picard will also download extra credits such as the "
"musicians who performed on it, the composer and lyricist, and related works. "
"This gives you much richer tags.\n"
"\n"
"It is turned off by default because it downloads more data from the "
"MusicBrainz servers, which makes loading albums a little slower and adds "
"load to the servers. Enable it if you want the most complete tags and don't "
"mind the extra loading time."
msgstr ""
"对于每首曲目，Picard 还会下载额外的信息，例如参与演出的音乐家、作曲家和作词人"
"，以及相关作品。这将使您的标签信息更加丰富。\n"
"\n"
"该功能默认处于关闭状态，因为它会从 MusicBrainz 服务器下载更多数据，这会使加载"
"专辑的速度稍慢，并增加服务器负载。如果您希望获得最完整的标签信息，且不介意额"
"外的加载时间，请启用此功能。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:460
msgid ""
"Replace typographic Unicode punctuation with plain ASCII equivalents in tags "
"— mainly curly apostrophes (’) become straight single quotes ('). Curly "
"double quotes (“ and ”) become straight quotes (\"), and dashes (—) become "
"hyphens (-).\n"
"\n"
"Useful if your player or file system does not handle these characters well."
msgstr ""
"在标签中将排版用 Unicode 标点符号替换为普通 ASCII 对应符号——主要是将卷曲撇号 "
"(’) 替换为直撇号 (')。卷曲双引号 (“ 和 ”) 替换为直引号 (\")，破折号 (—) 替换"
"为连字符 (-)。\n"
"\n"
"如果您的播放器或文件系统无法很好地处理这些字符，此操作将非常有用。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:472
msgid "You can change this later under Options → Options → Metadata."
msgstr "您稍后可以在“选项”→“选项”→“元数据”中进行更改。"

#: picard/ui/setupwizard.py:500
msgid "Picard Setup"
msgstr "Picard 设置"

#: picard/ui/itemviews/columns.py:189 picard/ui/tagsfromfilenames.py:127
#: picard/ui/tagsfromfilenames.py:138
msgid "File Name"
msgstr "文件名"

#: picard/ui/tutorial.py:49
msgid ""
"Welcome to MusicBrainz Picard! Start by adding your music files: use 'Add "
"Files' or 'Add Directory' from the toolbar or the File menu."
msgstr ""
"欢迎使用 MusicBrainz Picard！首先请添加您的音乐文件：可通过工具栏或“文件”菜单"
"中的“添加文件”或“添加目录”选项进行操作。"

#: picard/ui/tutorial.py:57
msgid ""
"Your files are now in the left pane under 'Unmatched Files'. Next step: "
"click 'Cluster' in the toolbar to group them by album, or select files and "
"use 'Lookup' or 'Scan' to identify them."
msgstr ""
"您的文件现在位于左侧窗格的“未匹配文件”下。下一步：点击工具栏中的“聚类”按钮，"
"按专辑对它们进行分组；或者选中文件，使用“查询”或“扫描”功能来识别它们。"

#: picard/ui/tutorial.py:66
msgid ""
"Files have been grouped into clusters by album. Now select a cluster and "
"click 'Lookup' in the toolbar to find the matching MusicBrainz release."
msgstr ""
"文件已按专辑分组。现在选择一个聚类，然后点击工具栏中的“查询”，即可查找匹配的 "
"MusicBrainz 发行版本。"

#: picard/ui/tutorial.py:75
msgid ""
"Picard is looking up your selection on MusicBrainz. Matched albums will "
"appear in the right pane. You can then review the metadata before saving."
msgstr ""
"Picard 正在 MusicBrainz 上查找您选择的内容。匹配的专辑将显示在右侧窗格中。您"
"可以在保存前查看元数据。"

#: picard/ui/tutorial.py:84
msgid ""
"Picard is generating audio fingerprints and looking up your files on "
"AcoustID. Matched files will move to the right pane automatically."
msgstr ""
"Picard 正在生成音频指纹，并通过 AcoustID 查询您的文件。匹配的文件将自动移至右"
"侧窗格。"

#: picard/ui/tutorial.py:93
msgid ""
"An album has been loaded in the right pane and files have been matched to "
"tracks. The color indicates match quality: green means a good match. Review "
"the results, then click 'Save' in the toolbar to write the new tags to your "
"files."
msgstr ""
"右侧窗格中已加载了一个专辑，文件已与曲目配对。颜色表示配对质量：绿色表示配对"
"良好。请检查结果，然后点击工具栏中的“保存”按钮，将新标签写入您的文件中。"

#: picard/ui/tutorial.py:103
msgid ""
"The metadata view shows tags for the selected item. 'Original Value' is "
"what's currently in your file, 'New Value' is what Picard will write. Double-"
"click a value to edit it. When you're happy with the tags, click 'Save' in "
"the toolbar to write them."
msgstr ""
"元数据视图显示所选项目的标签。“原始值”是文件中当前的内容，“新值”是 Picard 将"
"写入的内容。双击某个值即可进行编辑。当您对标签满意后，请点击工具栏中的“保存”"
"按钮将其写入。"

#: picard/ui/tutorial.py:114
msgid ""
"Cover art for the selected item is shown here. You can drag and drop images, "
"or right-click for more options."
msgstr "此处显示所选项目的封面图。您可以拖放图片，或右键单击以查看更多选项。"

#: picard/ui/tutorial.py:122
msgid ""
"Saving writes the new metadata to your files. If renaming or moving is "
"enabled in the options, files will also be renamed or moved accordingly."
msgstr ""
"保存操作会将新的元数据写入您的文件。如果在选项中启用了重命名或移动功能，文件"
"也会相应地被重命名或移动。"

#: picard/ui/tutorial.py:131
msgid ""
"You can drag files between the left and right panes to manually match them "
"to albums and tracks, or drag them back to unmatch. To add an album to the "
"right pane, use 'Lookup' on a cluster, search for it via 'Search', or paste "
"a MusicBrainz URL."
msgstr ""
"您可以在左右两个窗格之间拖动文件，以手动将其与专辑和曲目进行配对，或者将文件"
"拖回原处以取消配对。要将专辑添加到右侧窗格，请对聚类使用“查找”功能，通过“搜索"
"”功能进行查找，或粘贴 MusicBrainz 链接。"

